+# 0002: use cases talk to storage through ports
+
+A use case in `src/app` imports `../infra` only through `src/infra/index.ts`. It never imports
+`../infra/db/order-repository` or the `pg` package, and it never calls `import('../infra/db/pool')`.
+The composition root, `src/main.ts`, is the one place that builds `PgOrderRepository`.
